WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.875
Adding and multiplying start together, then they split apart.

2
00:00:04.652 --> 00:00:07.902
The dashed line adds one hundred every half hour.

3
00:00:10.721 --> 00:00:13.771
Now the solid line doubles every half hour.

4
00:00:14.598 --> 00:00:18.223
Same start and same first step, and then it runs away.
